<title>USA: TWA names senior vice president-planning.</title>
<headline>TWA names senior vice president-planning.</headline>
<dateline>ST. LOUIS 1996-09-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trans World Airlines Inc said Tuesday it named Roden Brandt to the new position of senior vice president-planning. He will report directly to Jeffrey Erickson, president and chief executive officer.</p>
<p>Brandt most recently was president of Air South, a South Carolina-based startup carrier.</p>
<p>	   -- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787</p>
